cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "hapGWAS: Adaptive Collapsed Joint haplotype association under LMM projection"
message: If you use this software, please cite it as below.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Yang
    given-names: Yancong
    affiliation: China Agricultural University
license: MIT
version: 0.4.1
date-released: "2026-11-05"
repository-code: "https://github.com/YancyYang02/hapGWAS"
url: "https://github.com/YancyYang02/hapGWAS"
abstract: >
  hapGWAS implements block haplotype GWAS scores under a shared null LMM
  projection, including the Adaptive Collapsed Joint (ACJ) Hamming-neighborhood
  multi-allelic score, full joint, PCA/ridge, and allele/SNP baselines.
keywords:
  - haplotype GWAS
  - linear mixed model
  - adaptive collapse
  - livestock genomics
